INFO  2026-04-28T01:22:43 +0ms service=decision-log taskID=tsk_dd1a374080011RUk5GR3GNTakv key=naming_convention value=## File and Variable Naming
```text
# File naming
- TypeScript files: camelCase.ts (generator.ts, candlestickChart.tsx)
- Test files: *.test.ts (generator.test.ts)
- React components: PascalCase.tsx (CandlestickChart.tsx, Header.tsx)
- Directories: kebab-case (data-engine, chart-components)

# Variable naming
- Types/Interfaces: PascalCase (OHLCV, StockInfo, IndicatorValues)
- Functions: camelCase (generateCandles, calculateIndicators)
- Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE (AVAILABLE_STOCKS)
- React hooks: useCamelCase (useStockData, useChartInteractions)
- CSS classes: kebab-case (chart-container, candle-up)

# Component structure
- One component per file
- Default export for page components
- Named exports for shared components
- Index.ts for clean exports from directories
